+	 *
+	 * The high nibble carries the state and the low nibble is a flag that
+	 * varies, so 0xa0, 0xa1 and 0xaf all mean "running". Requiring exactly
+	 * 0xa3 meant this driver only got past the wait by luck, and it polled ten
